Intentionally empty.

pgaudit 18.0 already suppresses logging in parallel workers upstream, so the
parallel_workers patch carried for v14..v17 is not needed here -- applying it
fails with "Reversed (or previously applied) patch detected".

This file exists so that the unconditional COPY of
compute/patches/pgaudit-parallel_workers-${PG_VERSION}.patch in
compute/compute-node.Dockerfile still resolves for v18. The Dockerfile skips
applying it for v18; see the comment there.
